{
  "name": "Dev AI Lab",
  "description": "Dev AI Lab is a containerized local-LLM development environment that unifies JupyterLab, multiple AI coding assistants, and three inference backends (Ollama, vLLM, SGLang) behind a Go GPU-arbiter reverse proxy that enforces single-GPU mutual exclusion and supports a head/worker cluster mode. It runs open-weight models entirely on local hardware with automatic GPU management and runtime-verified capability detection. Note: this project has over 100 source files; consider scoping analysis to a subdirectory for faster results.",
